<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Tuesday show that net currency reserves fell to about 106.0 billion marks in the week ending October 31 from about 107.0 billion in the week ending October 23.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Oct 31	  Oct 23</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     122.3	   122.8</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.3	    15.8</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
